{"html":"<h2 id=\"cracking-ssh-key\">Cracking SSH Key</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-extract-hash-from-ssh-private-key\">1. Extract Hash from SSH Private Key</h3>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">ssh2john &lt;SSH private key&gt; &gt; &lt;SSH private key hash filename&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"cracking-pdf-file\">Cracking PDF File</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-extract-hash-from-pdf-file\">1. Extract Hash from PDF File</h3>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">pdf2john &lt;PDF filename&gt; &gt; &lt;PDF hash filename&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"2-cracking-the-hash\">2. Cracking the Hash</h2>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">john --wordlist=&lt;wordlist path&gt; &lt;hash filename&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n","toc":[{"id":"cracking-ssh-key","title":"Cracking SSH Key","level":2},{"id":"1-extract-hash-from-ssh-private-key","title":"1. Extract Hash from SSH Private Key","level":3},{"id":"cracking-pdf-file","title":"Cracking PDF File","level":2},{"id":"1-extract-hash-from-pdf-file","title":"1. Extract Hash from PDF File","level":3},{"id":"2-cracking-the-hash","title":"2. Cracking the Hash","level":2}]}